\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S1}{\ignorespaces  Spatial clustering of the 40 Spanish stations obtained from the fitted conditional extremes dissimilarity matrix for spring, using the complete time siries. Three clusters are used in each fit. Colours distinguish cluster membership within each panel. Background shading represents elevation. \relax }}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
