\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S2}{\ignorespaces  Aggregated pairwise dissimilarities between the fitted conditional extremes models at the 40 Spanish stations for winter. Results are shown separately for season-years 1960--1998 and 1999--2020. Each matrix entry represents the estimated dissimilarity between the extremal temperature--DPI dependence structures at the corresponding pair of stations. Smaller values indicate more similar fitted dependence structures, while larger values indicate greater dissimilarity. Stations are ordered according to the corresponding three-cluster solution. \relax }}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:diss_winter}{{S2}{3}{Aggregated pairwise dissimilarities between the fitted conditional extremes models at the 40 Spanish stations for winter. Results are shown separately for season-years 1960--1998 and 1999--2020. Each matrix entry represents the estimated dissimilarity between the extremal temperature--DPI dependence structures at the corresponding pair of stations. Smaller values indicate more similar fitted dependence structures, while larger values indicate greater dissimilarity. Stations are ordered according to the corresponding three-cluster solution. \relax }{figure.caption.2}{}}
