\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S8}{\ignorespaces  Spatial clustering of the 40 Spanish stations obtained from the fitted conditional extremes dissimilarity matrices. Winter is fitted separately for season-years 1960--1998 and 1999--2020, summer for 1960--1990 and 1991--2020, and autumn for 1960--1986 and 1987--2020. Four clusters are used in each fit. Colours distinguish cluster membership within each panel. Background shading represents elevation. \relax }}{8}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
